  "goodToKnow": "Pflegebedürftig means in need of (long-term) care: pflegebedürftige Menschen, pflegebedürftig werden. Germany introduced compulsory long-term care insurance (Pflegeversicherung) in 1995. An assessment assigns a Pflegegrad from 1 to 5, which determines support. Most people in need of care are looked after at home, often by relatives. Bedürftig means needy."
